          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aaba omundu nali ne libiimba mala liaona, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne abuundu niio libiimba liaba khandu khawaanga namwe khabesemu khabonekha, akhoya acha eyekesia khu musaayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omusaayi alamumenieelesia, ne yaba ne liyabile liekha khukhila siikhoba sisialibotookhelesia, mala kamaswa mu bwenomwo bwakaluukhane bwakwile buwaanga, omusaayi alekesia omundu oyo khuba nali okhali omutakaase tawe. Aba buli bulwaale bwe kamakele burakikhire mwibiimba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne aaba omusaayi namenieelesia mala anyoole ali kamaswa kalimo se kakaluukhane mala bwakwile buwaanga tawe, lundi liboondo se liayabile lukali khukhila siikhoba sisiabotookhelesiao tawe, ne kakhali awangie, omusaayi alamwaukhasia mu baandu abe yeng'ene khulwe chindaalo saba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Liaba likoonjo ne limalatane khu siikhoba, omusaayi alekesia omundu oyo khuba okhetakaasile tawe Sikila ali ne bulwaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne liaba ne lisikala busa lirio ne likhamalatane tawe, aba eli embala busa eye libiimba. Ne omusaayi alekesia ali, ali omutakaase.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ne omundu aya kumulilo ne lubabia ne lukwa luwaanga namwe lubesemu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omusaayi alamumenieelesia. Kaaba kamaswa ka abuundu ao ne kakaluukhane kakwa buwaanga mala abonekhana ayabile lukali, achile mukari khukhila siikhoba sisiabotookhelesiao aba kamakele niko. Aba karakikhile mumbala. Ne omusaayi alekesia ali, se ali omutakaase tawe. Buli bulwaale bwe kamakele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali omusaayi alemenieelesiao mala kaaba bali kamaswa ke abwenao se kakaluukhane akwile awaanga tawe, ne se ayabile achile mukari khukhila siikhoba sisiabotookhelesiao tawe, ne kakhali alikho awaanga atiiti, omusaayi alamurusia mu baandu abe yeng'ene khulwe chindaalo saba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omusaayi alamumenieelesia lundi khu ndaalo eya saba. Ne aba ne lilikho limalatana khu siikhoba, aba buli bulwaale bwe kamakele, ne omusaayi alekesia ali, omundu oyo se ali omutakaase tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali aba na asikale busa ario khukaluukhanakho tawe, namwe se alikho amalatana tawe, ali busa awaanga, aba se kali kamakele tawe. Omusaayi alekesia ali, ali omutakaase sikila lili busa likoonjo lie khuya kumulilo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.28",
